.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH ckman-piv-certificates-delete 1  ckman 
.SH NAME
ckman\-piv\-certificates\-delete \- Delete the certificate in a slot (the key is retained)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBckman\-piv\-certificates\-delete\fR [\fB\-m\fR|\fB\-\-management\-key\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISLOT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Delete the certificate in a slot (the key is retained).
.PP
Existing certificates require explicit confirmation (default: no).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-m\fR, \fB\-\-management\-key\fR \fI<MANAGEMENT_KEY>\fR
Current management key as 48 hex characters (prompted when needed)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fISLOT\fR>
PIV certificate slot (9a, 9c, 9d, 9e, 82\-95, or f9)
